WEBVTT

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:02.468
and we built this truck and this rig.

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:04.988
We did sort of a simulation,

00:05:04.988 --> 00:05:06.814
because you had video discs,

00:05:06.814 --> 00:05:09.142
and again, this is '76.

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:11.839
And then many years later,

00:05:11.839 --> 00:05:13.308
you get this truck,

00:05:13.308 --> 00:05:16.266
and so you have Google Maps.

00:05:16.266 --> 00:05:17.786
Still people thought,

00:05:17.786 --> 00:05:21.806
no, that was not serious computer science,

00:05:21.806 --> 00:05:23.865
and it was a man named Jerry Wiesner,

00:05:23.865 --> 00:05:26.272
who happened to be the president of MIT,

00:05:26.272 --> 00:05:28.620
who did think it was computer science.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:31.257
And one of the keys for anybody